{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lustle</strong> is a small <strong>RTS game</strong> created by a single 18 years old indie game developer (me). The game revolves around <strong>team-vs-team battles</strong> on a <strong>procedural map</strong>, all presented in a <strong>cheerful pixel art style</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each faction is inspired by insects, featuring unique gameplay that reflects their real-life behaviors, blended with elements of human culture from various regions of the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447760/extras/767f8380967b989568a1e38c3261a2eb.poster.avif?t=1767747531\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447760/extras/767f8380967b989568a1e38c3261a2eb.webm?t=1767747531\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447760/extras/767f8380967b989568a1e38c3261a2eb.mp4?t=1767747531\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>In the game, you will need to choose a faction based on the strengths and weaknesses of your team, the procedurally generated map, and your personal playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Depending on the faction you select, you can extract different resources, so the distribution of resources and the composition of your team are key factors when deciding on a faction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is in an <strong>early stage of development</strong>, and it's very possible that my vision for it will evolve over time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447760/extras/26b67360f4dfba7ec4a5dbc8ae7ad6a2.poster.avif?t=1767747531\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447760/extras/26b67360f4dfba7ec4a5dbc8ae7ad6a2.webm?t=1767747531\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447760/extras/26b67360f4dfba7ec4a5dbc8ae7ad6a2.mp4?t=1767747531\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3447760?t=1767747531","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3447760?t=1767747531","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447760/d3642cfe323477fa4b8ad4a65d223358dc59b1cf/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767747531","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447760/d3642cfe323477fa4b8ad4a65d223358dc59b1cf/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767747531","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lustle</strong> is a small <strong>RTS game</strong> created by a single 18 years old indie game developer (me). The game revolves around <strong>team-vs-team battles</strong> on a <strong>procedural map</strong>, all presented in a <strong>cheerful pixel art style</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each faction is inspired by insects, featuring unique gameplay that reflects their real-life behaviors, blended with elements of human culture from various regions of the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poste